Algorithm
1. Start.
2. Initialize head = NULL.
3. Display the menu of operations.
4. Accept the user's choice.
5. If the choice is 1, insert an employee record at the beginning.
6. If the choice is 2, insert an employee record at the end.
7. If the choice is 3, delete an employee record using Employee ID.
8. If the choice is 4, search for an employee using Employee ID.
9. If the choice is 5, display all employee records.
10. If the choice is 0, terminate the program.
11. Otherwise, display an invalid-choice message.
12. Repeat steps 3–11 until the user chooses 0.
13. Free the remaining nodes and stop.
